# Build output and generated types.
dist/
.astro/

# SweatBox reference data, built from the sector packages by
# scripts/build-sweatbox.mjs. 247 generated files, ~2.8 MB, and nobody reads
# them — formatting them would churn the diff on every AIRAC and change
# nothing. Anchored with a leading slash so it means this one directory:
# an unanchored `data/` matches at any depth.
/src/data/sweatbox/

# VATSpy's open airport coordinates, served verbatim. 468 KB on one line —
# formatting it would produce a six-figure line count and change nothing anybody
# reads. can-web ignores its copy for the same reason.
#
# This one is **open data**, unlike src/data/sweatbox/ above: it is what lets the
# generator locate a destination airport outside the sector packages' area, and
# without it every generated route planner call fails to find its destination —
# silently, because the island's fetch has a bare `.catch(() => {})`.
public/airports.json
